CONCLUSION:
-----------
*Producers: Applications that send data to kafka topic
*Topics: Communication channel(Logical channels to which producers send data and from which consumers read data
*Consumers: Applications that subscribe to topics and process the data
*Consumer Groups: Groups of consumers that share the load of reading from topics.

What is ZooKeeper:
------------------
Manages and coordinates kafka brokers
Handles configuration,
synchronization and leader election





